(7697945, 1262884, 173844, '<td valign="top">Here''s an image that invites one to ponder.  The miniaturization of the people invites thought of our place in this immensity.  The foreground and background, whatever in nature that is, are overwhelming.  Not knowing what the background is amplifies the great mysteries of, well, everything.  The color palette is serene and generous.  In its quiet way, dazzling.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Here''s an image that invites one to ponder.  The miniaturization of the people invites thought of our place in this immensity.  The foreground and background, whatever in nature that is, are overwhelming.  Not knowing what the background is amplifies the great mysteries of, well, everything.  The color palette is serene and generous.  In its quiet way, dazzling.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2021-07-23 00:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7697946, 1262859, 97225, '<td valign="top">Great setup, great photo. I love the reddish light - looks like a Martian sunset glow.</td>', 'Great setup, great photo. I love the reddish light - looks like a Martian sunset glow.', '2021-07-23 00:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
